ps (3):** Explain the concept and connect it to Concentration dependent term of rate (Equation, Rate constant, Elementary and non-elementary reactions), Molecularity and order of reaction..\n\n**Application/example (2):** Apply it to a realistic CHEMICAL REACTION ENGINEERING & THERMODYNAMICS task and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1):** Check the result and mention a relevant limitation or risk.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** Introduction & Basic concept of thermodynamics is covered in “Introduction & Basic concept of thermodynamics”. Define it, describe the main steps/components, relate it to Introduction & Basic concept of thermodynamics, give an example and mention a check or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3):** Explain the concept and connect it to Introduction & Basic concept of thermodynamics.\n\n**Application/example (2):** Apply it to a realistic CHEMICAL REACTION ENGINEERING & THERMODYNAMICS task and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1):** Check the result and mention a relevant limitation or risk.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning (2):** PVT behavior of pure fluids is covered in “PVT Behaviour”. Define it, describe the main steps/components, relate it to Ideal gas and equation of state, Ideal gas Process (Constant Volume process, Constant Pressure process, Constant Temperature process, give an example and mention a check or limitation.\n\n**Principles/steps (3):** Explain the concept and connect it to Ideal gas and equation of state, Ideal gas Process (Constant Volume process, Constant Pressure process, Constant Temperature process.\n\n**Application/example (2):** Apply it to a realistic CHEMICAL REACTION ENGINEERING & THERMODYNAMICS task and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1):** Check the result and mention a relevant limitation or risk.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles 3; application 2; verification 1."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

